WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.254
Media coverage gaps.

00:00:02.204 --> 00:00:04.136
What they won't tell you.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:13.011
This page documents ten facts that are publicly available from official government records but are consistently underreported or unreported by Canadian mainstream media.

00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:17.602
Each fact is sourced from the same official data that journalists have access to.

00:00:17.602 --> 00:00:23.454
The gap between what is documented and what is reported is the media capture documented across this site.

00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:28.022
The CBC receives one point four billion dollars from the government it covers.

00:00:28.022 --> 00:00:31.704
Three companies control sixty percent of Canadian media.

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:34.863
The CRTC regulates who broadcasts.

00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:37.624
The coverage gaps are not accidental.

00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:39.454
They are structural.

00:00:39.454 --> 00:00:42.749
Ten facts the media consistently underreports.

00:00:42.749 --> 00:00:45.397
Each sourced from official government data.

00:00:45.397 --> 00:00:47.613
Why these gaps exist.

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:50.693
The media coverage gaps are not accidental.

00:00:50.693 --> 00:00:54.409
They are the product of the media capture documented on this site.

00:00:54.409 --> 00:00:58.522
The CBC receives one point four billion dollars from the government.

00:00:58.522 --> 00:01:01.818
Three companies control sixty percent of the market.

00:01:01.818 --> 00:01:04.977
The CRTC regulates who broadcasts.

00:01:04.977 --> 00:01:14.738
Each gap represents a synthesis that the captured media cannot perform: connecting MAID to Brookfield, connecting immigration to credential barriers, connecting debt service to pension capture.

00:01:14.738 --> 00:01:17.227
Individual facts are reported.

00:01:17.227 --> 00:01:19.852
The connections between them are not.

00:01:19.852 --> 00:01:25.874
TENET5 exists because the captured media will not compile the picture that these ten facts create when connected.
